{
  "name": "Agentic RAG Agent - Google Drive + MongoDB Atlas + OpenAI",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Ingestion (runs automatically)\nDrop a file into the watched Google Drive folder and the two triggers fire. Supported: PDF, CSV, XLSX, TXT, Google Docs (converted to text) and Google Sheets (converted to CSV).\n\nEvery run: upsert the file's metadata, wipe any old chunks and rows for that file, download it, route by type, then embed into MongoDB Atlas.\n\n**Setup:** pick your watched folder on both triggers, select your Google Drive credential on the triggers and the Download node, and select **MongoDB account 2** on every MongoDB node.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
