    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. The Agentic Agent\nOne AI Agent, four tools, and it decides at runtime which to call:\n- **searchDocuments** vector search (RAG) over chunks in `local_docs`\n- **listDocuments** what files exist (and the column schema for tabular files)\n- **getFileContents** pull the full text of one file when a snippet isn't enough\n- **queryDocumentRows** run a MongoDB aggregation over the rows of a CSV/XLSX for sums, averages, counts\n\nChat memory lives in `local_chat_history`. Open the chat panel at the bottom of the canvas to test.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5533a38a-7c1a-48b2-bc8b-7a43e5fbc8c3",
      "name": "Sticky Note 23",
